[I] Python FFmpeg command line wrapper

[T] ffmpy is a simple FFmpeg command line wrapper. It implements a Pythonic
[T] interface for FFmpeg command line compilation and uses Python’s
[T] subprocess to execute the compiled command line.

[U] https://github.com/Ch00k/ffmpy

